# Spike sample playlist
#
# IMPORTANT: point Spike at sources you are licensed to access (your own
# IPTV provider's playlist, streams from rights-holders, or official free
# channels like the ones below). See LEGAL.md in the repository root.
#
# The entries below are official, freely offered public channels used to
# demonstrate the pipeline end-to-end. Red Bull TV is listed first because
# its CDN serves a clean live window; some NASA mirrors intermittently
# serve stale variant lists.

#EXTM3U
#EXTINF:-1 tvg-id="redbull.tv" group-title="Action Sports",Red Bull TV
